Thumbs.db


# ============================================================
# Research data
#
# The book (data/raw/) and intermediate files stay local.
#
# data/processed/ (turns, sentences, coding workbook, manifest) is
# committed. These files hold the debate text, so the repository
# must stay private while they are in it.
#
# data/metadata/ is intentionally NOT ignored because manifests
# and source metadata should be version controlled.
# ============================================================

data/raw/**
data/interim/**


# Keep empty data directories in the repository
!data/raw/.gitkeep
!data/interim/.gitkeep
!data/processed/.gitkeep